    "po_rescope_note": "FILED AS DIRECT-FIX, NOT THE FULL BA->ARCHITECT->PM CHAIN THE REPORTER REQUESTED. Rationale, so this is auditable rather than a silent downgrade: the design is fully determined before any architect touches it — the schema CHECK constraint hands us the enum, the remedy pattern is already shipped and proven in this exact file for 4 sibling counts, an existing regression test file is already in place, and PO verified the consumer set is 3 files with a generic passthrough at the 4th. Blast radius is additive-only. The one genuine design trap (running vs failure, see AC-2) is resolved in the ACs above rather than deferred. Sending a 3-file additive change with a written predicate through 3 planning agents is process cost with no design left to buy. If the implementer disagrees and finds a real contract break in AC-3, escalate back to PO and this reroutes to architect — do not silently widen scope.",
